<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>About Us – Gameso | Play Free Online Games</title>

  <meta name="description" content="Learn more about Gameso, a free online gaming platform where you can discover and play fun browser games including puzzle, arcade, racing, action, and strategy games.">

  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">

  <link rel="canonical" href="https://gameso.vercel.app/about-us">

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f8fc;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 60px 20px 80px;
    }

    .about-hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .about-label {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #6366f1;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about-hero p {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .about-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    .about-card h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .about-card p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .about-section {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    .about-section h2 {
      font-size: 27px;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .about-section p {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .about-list {
      padding-left: 22px;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .about-list li {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .about-cta {
      background: #111827;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 42px 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .about-cta h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-cta p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    .about-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #6366f1;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .about-button:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {

      .about-container {
        padding: 40px 16px 60px;
      }

      .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .about-hero p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-card,
      .about-section {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .about-card h2,
      .about-section h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .about-cta h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="about-container">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="about-hero">

      <span class="about-label">About Gameso</span>

      <h1>About Gameso – Play Free Online Games</h1>

      <p>
        Welcome to Gameso, a simple and growing online gaming platform where
        you can discover and play fun, engaging games directly in your browser.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Main Information -->
    <section class="about-grid">

      <article class="about-card">

        <h2>What Is Gameso?</h2>

        <p>
          Gameso is an online gaming platform featuring a growing collection
          of browser games across different categories. Visitors can discover
          and play games such as 2048, Minesweeper, Snake, Tic Tac Toe,
          Memory Game, Traffic Racer, Flappy Bird, Pong, Breakout, and more.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="about-card">

        <h2>Our Goal</h2>

        <p>
          Our goal is to provide a simple and enjoyable gaming experience for
          visitors of different skill levels. We focus on easy navigation,
          straightforward game instructions, and a variety of games that are
          easy to discover.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="about-card">

        <h2>Play Games Online</h2>

        <p>
          Gameso allows visitors to discover and play games directly through
          their web browser. Game pages can include information such as how
          to play, controls, rules, and helpful tips.
        </p>

      </article>


      <article class="about-card">

        <h2>Designed for Easy Access</h2>

        <p>
          Gameso is designed to provide a straightforward browsing experience
          on desktop and mobile devices. Players can explore different
          categories and quickly find games they want to play.
        </p>

      </article>

    </section>


    <!-- Explore Games -->
    <section class="about-section">

      <h2>Explore Games on Gameso</h2>

      <p>
        Gameso features different types of online games for players with
        different interests. You can explore puzzle games, arcade games,
        racing games, action games, strategy games, brain games, and other
        browser-based experiences.
      </p>

      <p>
        Whether you have a few minutes for a quick puzzle or want to spend
        more time playing an arcade or racing game, Gameso makes it easy to
        discover different games in one place.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Why Gameso -->
    <section class="about-section">

      <h2>Why Visit Gameso?</h2>

      <ul class="about-list">

        <li>A growing collection of free online games</li>

        <li>Multiple game categories</li>

        <li>Simple and easy-to-use interface</li>

        <li>Browser-based gaming</li>

        <li>Helpful game instructions and information</li>

        <li>Designed for desktop and mobile users</li>

        <li>Easy navigation for discovering new games</li>

      </ul>

    </section>


    <!-- Content -->
    <section class="about-section">

      <h2>Our Content & Games</h2>

      <p>
        We aim to provide useful and original information about the games
        available on Gameso. Game descriptions, instructions, controls, and
        tips are created to help visitors understand each game and enjoy
        their gaming experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        We continue to improve Gameso by adding new games, improving
        navigation, and providing useful information for players.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- Website Experience -->
    <section class="about-section">

      <h2>A Simple Online Gaming Experience</h2>

      <p>
        Gameso is built around a simple idea: make it easy for visitors to
        find interesting games and start playing them online. Our website
        brings different types of browser games together so visitors can
        explore new games without complicated navigation.
      </p>

      <p>
        We are continuously working on improving the website and creating a
        better experience for visitors across different devices.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="about-cta">

      <h2>Keep Exploring Gameso</h2>

      <p>
        Discover new games, explore different categories, and find something
        fun to play directly in your browser.
      </p>

      <a href="/" class="about-button">
        Explore Games
      </a>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
